    G1->>L: Counterexample / failure trace
    L->>L: Root-cause latent semantic defect
    L->>B: Propose shared basis repair ΔB
    B->>T: Re-run target + adversarial non-regression tests
    T-->>B: Repair target passes; prior law preserved
    B->>G1: Re-run with ΔB
    G1-->>E: Real executed witness
    E-->>L: Level 4 conforms
    B->>G2: Apply identical ΔB, zero new edits
    G2-->>E: Real executed witness
    E-->>L: Level 4 conforms
    Note over L,B: Observed leverage: 1 discovered law → N consequential worlds
